{"seq":2,"slug":"shap","title":"SHAP 沙普利值归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/local-methods/shap","wordCount":1865,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"shap-沙普利值归因\">SHAP 沙普利值归因</h1><p><a href=\"lime\">LIME</a> 给出局部解释，但它的系数会随核宽和采样而变——同一个样本跑两次可能两个答案。一个自然的追问是：有没有一种局部归因，是唯一确定、且有理论保证「公平」的？SHAP 的回答来自一个意想不到的领域——1953 年的合作博弈论。它把「每个特征对这次预测贡献了多少」这个问题，等价成了「每个玩家对合作总收益贡献了多少」这个有标准答案的经典问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SHAP 的核心，是把「每个特征对这次预测贡献了多少」翻译成一个有唯一答案的博弈论问题，并因此获得启发式方法给不了的理论保证。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Shapley 值</strong>：考察每个特征在所有可能「加入顺序」下的边际贡献并取加权平均，得到唯一满足一组公理的公平分账。</li>\n<li><strong>四条公理</strong>：可加性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j \\phi_j = f(x) - \\mathbb{E}[f(X)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span>）、对称性、虚拟性、一致性——这是它区别于 LIME 的根本。</li>\n<li><strong>一族近似</strong>：精确计算随特征数指数增长，故有 TreeSHAP（树·精确）、DeepSHAP、KernelSHAP（任意黑箱·近似）、LinearSHAP 等按模型类型分流的加速算法。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>适用模型</th>\n<th>是否精确</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>KernelSHAP</td>\n<td>任意（模型无关）</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>本质是带特殊权重的加权线性回归，与 LIME 同形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TreeSHAP</td>\n<td>树/树集成</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>快（多项式）</td>\n<td>利用树结构，FastTreeSHAP 进一步加速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSHAP</td>\n<td>神经网络</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>基于 DeepLIFT 的逐层归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LinearSHAP</td>\n<td>线性模型</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>系数与特征值的闭式组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可加性让 SHAP 值可对账、可聚合，使它天然横跨局部与全局；但公理保证的是「给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 定义下分账公平」，并不免除共线性、基线选择等实践风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-shapley-值说起\">从 Shapley 值说起</h2><p>设想几个玩家合作完成一项任务，拿到总收益，怎么公平地分给每个人？Shapley 值给出唯一满足若干公理的分法：考察每个玩家「加入」联盟时带来的边际贡献，对所有可能的加入顺序取平均。把「玩家」换成「特征」、「收益」换成「模型预测」，就得到了特征归因。</p>\n<p>第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 个特征的 Shapley 值是它在所有特征子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 上的边际贡献的加权平均：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_j = \\sum_{S \\subseteq F \\setminus \\{j\\}} \\frac{|S|!\\,(|F|-|S|-1)!}{|F|!}\\big[v(S \\cup \\{j\\}) - v(S)\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.943em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是全部特征集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是只用特征子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 时模型的预测期望，方括号里是「把特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 加进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>」带来的预测变化。前面那个组合系数，正是「所有加入顺序」的平均权重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四条公理与可加性\">四条公理与可加性</h2><p>SHAP 真正的卖点是它满足一组解释方法该有的公理，这是 LIME 等启发式方法给不了的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可加性（efficiency/局部精确性）</strong>：所有特征的 SHAP 值之和，恰好等于这次预测与基线预测之差，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j \\phi_j = f(x) - \\mathbb{E}[f(X)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span>。每一份贡献都「分账分干净」，没有遗漏。</li>\n<li><strong>对称性</strong>：两个对模型贡献完全相同的特征，得到相同的 SHAP 值。</li>\n<li><strong>虚拟性（dummy）</strong>：对预测毫无影响的特征，SHAP 值恒为 0。</li>\n<li><strong>一致性</strong>：如果改了模型使某特征的边际贡献在所有子集上都不减小，它的 SHAP 值就不会减小。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>可加性这条尤其有用，它让 SHAP 解释天然可分解、可对账，也让单样本 SHAP 值能严谨地聚合成全局重要性（见<a href=\"../global-methods/feature-importance\">特征重要性</a>里的全局 SHAP）。这正是 SHAP 同时横跨局部与全局的根本原因——它是本 hub 里<a href=\"../local-methods/\">局部方法</a>与<a href=\"../global-methods/\">全局方法</a>之间最自然的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精确计算太贵-于是有了一族近似\">精确计算太贵，于是有了一族近似</h2><p>公式里要遍历所有特征子集，复杂度随特征数指数增长，精确计算对几十个特征以上就不可行。SHAP 的工程价值，很大程度来自一系列针对不同模型的近似/精确加速算法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Need[需要 Shapley 值] --&gt; Q{模型类型}&#10;    Q --&gt;|树模型| Tree[TreeSHAP&lt;br/&gt;多项式时间精确解]&#10;    Q --&gt;|神经网络| Deep[DeepSHAP&lt;br/&gt;基于 DeepLIFT 反传]&#10;    Q --&gt;|任意黑箱| Kernel[KernelSHAP&lt;br/&gt;加权线性回归近似]&#10;    Q --&gt;|线性模型| Lin[LinearSHAP&lt;br/&gt;系数闭式解]&#10;    Tree --&gt; Out[每特征 SHAP 值]&#10;    Deep --&gt; Out&#10;    Kernel --&gt; Out&#10;    Lin --&gt; Out&#10;    Out --&gt; Viz[force/waterfall/beeswarm 可视化]\">flowchart TD\n    Need[需要 Shapley 值] --&gt; Q{模型类型}\n    Q --&gt;|树模型| Tree[TreeSHAP&lt;br/&gt;多项式时间精确解]\n    Q --&gt;|神经网络| Deep[DeepSHAP&lt;br/&gt;基于 DeepLIFT 反传]\n    Q --&gt;|任意黑箱| Kernel[KernelSHAP&lt;br/&gt;加权线性回归近似]\n    Q --&gt;|线性模型| Lin[LinearSHAP&lt;br/&gt;系数闭式解]\n    Tree --&gt; Out[每特征 SHAP 值]\n    Deep --&gt; Out\n    Kernel --&gt; Out\n    Lin --&gt; Out\n    Out --&gt; Viz[force/waterfall/beeswarm 可视化]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>适用模型</th>\n<th>是否精确</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>KernelSHAP</td>\n<td>任意（模型无关）</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>本质是带特殊权重的加权线性回归，与 LIME 同形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TreeSHAP</td>\n<td>树/树集成</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>快（多项式）</td>\n<td>利用树结构，FastTreeSHAP 进一步加速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSHAP</td>\n<td>神经网络</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>基于 DeepLIFT 的逐层归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LinearSHAP</td>\n<td>线性模型</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>系数与特征值的闭式组合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个深刻的联系：KernelSHAP 其实就是 LIME 选用特定的邻近度核和损失函数后的特例——选对了核，LIME 的解就收敛到 Shapley 值。换句话说，SHAP 给 LIME 那套局部线性近似补上了「该用什么核才公平」的理论答案。</p>\n<p>截至 2026 年，SHAP 仍是最主流的归因工具，最新发布版本为 2026 年 3 月 4 日的 0.51.0，TreeSHAP 与 FastTreeSHAP v2 让大规模推理下的精确 Shapley 计算变得可行（来源：letsdatascience.com/blog/shap-and-lime-making-ai-models-explainable）。在欧盟 AI 法案 2026 年 8 月生效的背景下，把 SHAP 值与预测一同落库、用 beeswarm 图做全局文档，已成为高风险系统部署流水线的标准动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么读-shap-图\">怎么读 SHAP 图</h2><p>SHAP 的可视化是它好用的一半。<strong>force plot / waterfall</strong> 展示单样本：从基线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[f(X)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span> 出发，每个特征的 SHAP 值像一段段力把预测推高或拉低，终点就是这次的预测值——可加性在这里被画了出来。<strong>beeswarm（蜂群图）</strong> 是全局视图：每个特征一行，每个点是一个样本，横轴是 SHAP 值、颜色是特征大小，一眼看出某特征是高值推高还是推低预测。</p>\n<p>读图时务必记住 SHAP 值的真正含义：它是「相对于基线的贡献」，不是「这个特征的因果效应」。基线选什么（全体均值、某个参照样本）会改变所有 SHAP 值的解读。把 SHAP 值读成因果，是<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls\">陷阱与误读</a>里反复警告的错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shap-的代价与局限\">SHAP 的代价与局限</h2><p>SHAP 不是银弹。除了计算昂贵（KernelSHAP 尤甚），它在<strong>特征共线性</strong>下同样会失真：相关特征会把贡献相互分摊，单看某一个的 SHAP 值会低估其真实作用——这与<a href=\"../global-methods/feature-importance\">特征重要性</a>和 <a href=\"lime\">LIME</a> 遇到的是同一个共线性病根，公理保证并不能让它免疫（来源：mdpi.com/2079-9292/14/23/4766）。此外，KernelSHAP 的采样同样可能造出分布外组合。公理保证的是「在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 定义下分账公平」，不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 本身（即如何处理缺失特征）没有争议——条件期望还是边际期望，会给出不同的 SHAP 值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SHAP 把特征归因等价为合作博弈的 Shapley 值，给出唯一满足公理的「公平分账」。</li>\n<li>四条公理（可加性、对称性、虚拟性、一致性）是 LIME 等启发式方法给不了的理论保证。</li>\n<li>可加性让 SHAP 值可对账、可聚合，使它天然横跨局部与全局，是两章之间的桥梁。</li>\n<li>精确计算随特征数指数爆炸，故有 KernelSHAP/TreeSHAP/DeepSHAP/LinearSHAP 一族加速；KernelSHAP 是 LIME 的特例。</li>\n<li>共线性下仍会分摊失真、计算昂贵、SHAP 值是相对基线的贡献而非因果——公理保证不等于免疫所有坑。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SHAP 沙普利值归因","id":"shap-沙普利值归因"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Shapley 值说起","id":"从-shapley-值说起"},{"level":2,"text":"四条公理与可加性","id":"四条公理与可加性"},{"level":2,"text":"精确计算太贵，于是有了一族近似","id":"精确计算太贵-于是有了一族近似"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么读 SHAP 图","id":"怎么读-shap-图"},{"level":2,"text":"SHAP 的代价与局限","id":"shap-的代价与局限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"LIME 局部线性解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/local-methods/lime"},"next":{"title":"反事实解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/local-methods/counterfactual"}}